+ ## When to Use Which Endpoint
+ | You want to... | Use this | Free? |
+ |---|---|---|
+ | Search for a topic | `GET /ask?q=TOPIC` | Yes |
+ | Get trending stories | `GET /trending` | Yes |
+ | Browse a category | `GET /news?category=CAT` | $0.001 |
